t_Icon.png/30px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Level 4 Spell Slot\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Impel a storm of hail and ice to crash from the sky, covering the ground and striking all objects and creatures within range, dealing <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/38px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/50px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bludgeoning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">Bludgeoning</span></a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/38px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Cold\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Cold_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/05/Cold_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Cold\" title=\"Cold\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-cold\">Cold</span></a> damage. It also creates an <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ice_(surface)\" title=\"Ice (surface)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Ice_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Ice_surface_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Ice_surface_Icon.webp/38px-Ice_surface_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/89/Ice_surface_Icon.webp/50px-Ice_surface_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ice\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/89/Ice_surface_Icon.webp/25px-Ice_surface_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/89/Ice_surface_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>&nbsp;<a href=\"/wiki/Ice_(surface)\" title=\"Ice (surface)\">Ice</a> surface that lasts 2 turns. </dd>\n</dl></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Draconic_Prowess:_Frost\">Sources of Draconic Prowess: Frost</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Elixir_of_Dragonborn_Prowess:_Frost\" title=\"Elixir of Dragonborn Prowess: Frost\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/16/Bottle_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Bottle_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/16/Bottle_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Bottle_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/16/Bottle_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Bottle_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/16/Bottle_A_Unfaded